{"id":"u130","kelas":"kosa","no":15,"judul":"Kesalahan Umum Penutur Indonesia","title":"Common Mistakes","emoji":"🚫","ringkas":"I am agree, informations, discuss about, dan kesalahan lain yang sering terjadi","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali **kesalahan umum penutur Indonesia** dan memperbaikinya","menghindari **terjemahan langsung** seperti *I am agree* dan *discuss about*","memakai **kata kerja dan preposisi** yang benar","membedakan **kata yang terhitung dan tak terhitung** (information, advice)"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Banyak kesalahan bahasa Inggris berasal dari **menerjemahkan langsung** dari bahasa Indonesia. Pola kesalahannya sama pada hampir semua pembelajar, jadi sangat mudah dipelajari. Unit ini membahas kesalahan yang paling sering dan cara memperbaikinya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Kesalahan dengan to be dan kata kerja","table":[["Sering ditulis (salah)","Yang benar","Alasan"],["~~I am agree.~~","[[I agree.]]","agree sudah kata kerja, tanpa am"],["~~I have 20 years old.~~","[[I am 20 years old.]]","umur memakai be, bukan have"],["~~He don't like it.~~","[[He doesn't like it.]]","he/she/it → doesn't"],["~~Where you go?~~","[[Where do you go?]]","pertanyaan butuh do/does"],["~~She very like music.~~","[[She really likes music.]]","like tidak didahului very"],["~~I'm boring.~~","[[I'm bored.]]","bored = merasa bosan; boring = membosankan"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Kesalahan preposisi dan kata kerja berpasangan","table":[["Sering ditulis (salah)","Yang benar","Alasan"],["~~We discussed about the plan.~~","[[We discussed the plan.]]","discuss tanpa about"],["~~She reached to the station.~~","[[She reached the station.]]","reach tanpa to"],["~~He married with her.~~","[[He married her.]]","marry tanpa with"],["~~It depends of the weather.~~","[[It depends on the weather.]]","depend on"],["~~I'm afraid with dogs.~~","[[I'm afraid of dogs.]]","afraid of"],["~~She is good in English.~~","[[She is good at English.]]","good at"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Kesalahan kata benda dan kata ganti","table":[["Sering ditulis (salah)","Yang benar","Alasan"],["~~many informations~~","[[a lot of information]]","information tak terhitung"],["~~an advice~~","[[a piece of advice]]","advice tak terhitung"],["~~Open the light.~~","[[Turn on the light.]]","open dipakai untuk pintu, bukan lampu"],["~~I'm from Indonesian.~~","[[I'm from Indonesia.]] / [[I'm Indonesian.]]","negara vs kebangsaan"],["~~The price is expensive.~~","[[The price is high.]] / [[It's expensive.]]","harga: high/low; barang: expensive"],["~~more better~~","[[better]]","better sudah komparatif"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghindari kesalahan","text":"Saat menulis, tanyakan: *Apakah ini terjemahan langsung?* Jika iya, cek kata kerjanya (am/is/are, do/does) dan preposisi bawaannya. Simpan daftar kesalahanmu sendiri dan baca ulang tiap minggu."},{"t":"summary","items":["agree tanpa am; umur pakai am; he doesn't.","discuss, reach, marry tanpa preposisi.","depend on, afraid of, good at.","information dan advice tak terhitung.","bored (perasaan) vs boring (sifat)."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I agree with you.","I am agree with you.","I agreeing with you.","I am agreed with you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Agree sudah kata kerja.","k":"621fcf68"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She is twelve years old.","She has twelve years old.","She have twelve years.","She is having twelve years."],"answer":0,"exp":"Umur memakai be.","k":"77466913"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["He doesn't like fish.","He don't like fish.","He not like fish.","He doesn't likes fish."],"answer":0,"exp":"He → doesn't + V1.","k":"f20092ff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["Where do you live?","Where you live?","Where does you live?","Where live you?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Butuh do. Jawaban yang tepat: **Where do you live?**","k":"5144ac12"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She really likes music.","She very likes music.","She very like music.","She is very like music."],"answer":0,"exp":"Like tidak dengan very.","k":"902c39cd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I am bored with this lesson.","I am boring with this lesson.","I boring this lesson.","I am bore with this lesson."],"answer":0,"exp":"Bored = merasa bosan.","k":"1fe4afa5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["The film is boring.","The film is bored.","The film boring is.","The film are boring."],"answer":0,"exp":"Boring = membosankan.","k":"b20067e3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["We discussed the plan.","We discussed about the plan.","We discussed to the plan.","We discuss at the plan."],"answer":0,"exp":"Discuss tanpa about.","k":"23621624"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She reached the station at nine.","She reached to the station at nine.","She reached at the station at nine.","She reach the station at nine."],"answer":0,"exp":"Reach tanpa to.","k":"4d3ca61b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["He married her last year.","He married with her last year.","He married to her last year.","He marry her last year."],"answer":0,"exp":"Marry tanpa with.","k":"4efd3f08"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["It depends on the weather.","It depends of the weather.","It depends from the weather.","It depend the weather."],"answer":0,"exp":"Depend on. Jawaban yang tepat: **It depends on the weather.**","k":"213deba2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I'm afraid of dogs.","I'm afraid with dogs.","I'm afraid to dogs.","I'm afraid at dogs."],"answer":0,"exp":"Afraid of. Jawaban yang tepat: **I'm afraid of dogs.**","k":"fa3d5b71"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She is good at English.","She is good in English.","She is good on English.","She is good with English."],"answer":0,"exp":"Good at. Jawaban yang tepat: **She is good at English.**","k":"0fdf8bde"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["There is a lot of information on the internet.","There are many informations on the internet.","There is many information on the internet.","There are much informations on the internet."],"answer":0,"exp":"Information tak terhitung.","k":"0239038f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["Can you give me a piece of advice?","Can you give me an advice?","Can you give me advices?","Can you give me some advices?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Advice tak terhitung.","k":"79744afb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["Please turn on the light.","Please open the light.","Please on the light.","Please open on the light."],"answer":0,"exp":"Turn on the light.","k":"1bd56a44"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I'm from Indonesia.","I'm from Indonesian.","I'm come from Indonesian.","I from Indonesian."],"answer":0,"exp":"Negara: Indonesia.","k":"f879178f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["The price is high.","The price is expensive.","The price is much.","The price is big."],"answer":0,"exp":"Harga: high atau low.","k":"f660665f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["This phone is better than that one.","This phone is more better than that one.","This phone is more good than that one.","This phone is gooder than that one."],"answer":0,"exp":"Better sudah komparatif.","k":"05def5cb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She has lived here since 2015.","She lives here since 2015.","She is living here since 2015.","She has live here since 2015."],"answer":0,"exp":"Since → present perfect.","k":"6a8a3e46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I look forward to seeing you.","I look forward to see you.","I look forward seeing you.","I looking forward to seeing you."],"answer":0,"exp":"To + V-ing. Jawaban yang tepat: **I look forward to seeing you.**","k":"3d0d743b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I have been waiting for an hour.","I am waiting since an hour.","I waiting for one hour.","I have wait for one hour."],"answer":0,"exp":"Present perfect continuous.","k":"27b87acd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["I am agree with the rule.","I agree with the rule.","I am tired.","I disagree with you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Am agree salah.","k":"805e0fff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["We discussed about it yesterday.","We discussed it yesterday.","We talked about it yesterday.","We had a discussion about it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Discuss tanpa about.","k":"50023e32"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["He gave me many informations.","He gave me a lot of information.","He gave me some advice.","He gave me useful information."],"answer":0,"exp":"Informations salah.","k":"f6efc8d4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["I have 17 years old.","I am 17 years old.","I am seventeen.","My brother is ten years old."],"answer":0,"exp":"Umur pakai be.","k":"ffbcb989"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku setuju denganmu.","q":"I ___ with you.","answers":["agree"],"hint":"a _ _ _ _","exp":"Agree tanpa am.","k":"5953658f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia berumur dua belas tahun.","q":"She ___ twelve years old.","answers":["is"],"hint":"i _","exp":"Umur memakai be.","k":"6ea5cb13"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami membahas rencana itu.","q":"We discussed ___ plan.","answers":["the"],"hint":"t _ _","exp":"Discuss tanpa about; the plan.","k":"caf6f844"},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu tergantung cuaca.","q":"It depends ___ the weather.","answers":["on"],"hint":"o _","exp":"Depend on. Jawaban yang tepat: **on**.","k":"3066efec"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia takut anjing.","q":"She is afraid ___ dogs.","answers":["of"],"hint":"o _","exp":"Afraid of. Jawaban yang tepat: **of**.","k":"a7df80f4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hidupkan lampunya.","q":"Please turn ___ the light.","answers":["on"],"hint":"o _","exp":"Turn on the light.","k":"575427b1"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["She is good at maths.","She is good in maths.","She is good on maths.","She is good with maths."],"answer":0,"exp":"Good at. Jawaban yang tepat: **She is good at maths.**","k":"0d61c879"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I have been to Bali twice.","I have went to Bali twice.","I was been to Bali twice.","I am been to Bali twice."],"answer":0,"exp":"Have been. Jawaban yang tepat: **I have been to Bali twice.**","k":"8dd81577"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["Does she like tea?","Do she like tea?","Does she likes tea?","She does like tea?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Does + V1. Jawaban yang tepat: **Does she like tea?**","k":"c59eae2d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["He is married to Rani.","He is married with Rani.","He is marry Rani.","He is marrying to Rani."],"answer":0,"exp":"Be married to.","k":"a9f6629e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["We need some advice.","We need some advices.","We need an advice.","We need advices."],"answer":0,"exp":"Advice tak terhitung.","k":"b7304557"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar:","options":["I am interested in music.","I am interesting in music.","I interested in music.","I am interest on music."],"answer":0,"exp":"Interested in.","k":"e7c3ebf6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["I very like this song.","I really like this song.","I like this song very much.","I love this song."],"answer":0,"exp":"Very tidak dipasang sebelum like.","k":"36d4a7ac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["She reached to Jakarta.","She reached Jakarta.","She arrived in Jakarta.","She got to Jakarta."],"answer":0,"exp":"Reach tanpa to.","k":"8b4cdb86"}],"read":[]}